Homepage: https://github.com/dandelions/pdg2pdf-linux

Package: pdg2pdf-linux
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, python3-pil, python3-img2pdf, python3-pikepdf, djvulibre-bin
Description: native Linux PDG book converter
 Convert PDG books to PDF without Wine. Supports fake PDG image files,
 standard HH container pages, early encrypted PDG variants, ZIP input,
 PDF metadata and BookContents.dat bookmarks. Includes a command-line
 interface and a GTK3 desktop application.
